D1: verified-local is refused EXECUTION_PROFILE_NOT_READY, with the canonical {code, codeName, context}, on every path:
- settings activation through CQ-M05's control, which writes its refused 'activate' record naming vm, client and check;
- an explicit claim of a row with a stored verified-local snapshot (implicit claims never hand it out);
- complete_task, after an audited rollback, of an attempt whose own snapshot is verified-local (CQ-M05's attempt-level readiness);
